140 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 65 0 R
/E (At Gupta Export quality is the foundation of everything we create. From material selection to final finishing, every stage of our manufacturing process is carefully monitored to ensure durability, precision, and consistency. All timber used in our production is ethically sourced, properly seasoned, and chemically treated to enhance strength and longevity, making our furniture suitable for heavy commercial and hospitality use. Our skilled artisans combine traditional craftsmanship with modern machinery to achieve superior construction, refined finishes, and reliable performance. We follow strict quality control checks at every stage of production and welcome third-party inspections to ensure our products meet both domestic and international export standards. This commitment to quality allows us to deliver furniture that is not only visually refined but also built to perform over time in demanding environments. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
